{"parse": {"title": "十月无晴天-06", "pageid": 88957, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%81%E6%9C%88%E6%97%A0%E6%99%B4%E5%A4%A9-05\" title=\"十月无晴天-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">十月无晴天-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/%E5%8D%81%E6%9C%88%E6%97%A0%E6%99%B4%E5%A4%A9-07\" title=\"十月无晴天-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">十月无晴天</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E5.A0.A1.E5.9E.92.E5.9D.8D.E5.A1.8C.E4.B9.8B.E6.AD.8C\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"堡垒坍塌之歌\">堡垒坍塌之歌</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 堡垒坍塌之歌</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Fall of the Fortress</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_rongjunyuan1\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_rongjunyuan1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan1.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan1.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7f/Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan1.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_rongjunyuan1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>圣像游行当日，当第一缕霞光破云而入的时候，大家都以为雨季将要结束。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518411.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-518411.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518411.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518411.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-518411.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518411.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/46/HeadIconSmall-518411.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518411.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>你说老若热的衣服不合身？这已经是咱们最后一件了，大家怎么穿他就得怎么穿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>每人都要准备一支蜡烛，好好插在烛台上，切记不能倒了，也不能让雨淋到火苗子一点。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>你少喝一点儿吧，等游行结束了有的是你喝的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>醉鬼手上的酒杯被放倒，老金达穿行于每一个老人间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>福利院外一片混乱，吆喝着抬起圣像的大汉，端着烛台的普通群众，正在换上红袍的老人以及大庄园主。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>上校今天的胡子纹丝不动，即便龙卷风来了也吹不乱一根。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>游行什么时候结束？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>我的老天，还没开始你就想着结束。愿屠龙圣徒能原谅你的不虔诚！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>我要是虔诚，今日的午餐能多一块玉米面甜饼吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>你只要不添乱，要多少都有。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>上校不说话，他陷在轮椅里，乜斜着靠在一旁的军队。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>说实话，您是我见过最美的姑娘，我能瞧瞧您的手吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d6/HeadIconSmall-509301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">商贩女郎：</div><div>噢天哪，您可别乱说，我每天要杀三十条鱼呢！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">士兵Ⅰ：</div><div>但您仍然拥有着世界上最温柔的手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-518601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-518601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/37/HeadIconSmall-518601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>啧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>上校厌恶地撇撇嘴，他在寻找着一个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>莫阿西尔始终站在角落，旁观着这片欢闹的土地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>那混球，大衣里藏了什么东西。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他眯起眼思索，转动座椅滑轮准备前往马棚取一杆自己的枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>你要去干什么？巴斯托斯？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达挡住他的去路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">上校：</div><div>关你屁事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>圣像游行的事就是我的事，请快回到队伍里去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>上校——！小心！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>娜娜扛着她的麦克风从福利院大门里冲出，七零八落的电线将她的腿绞成一团，她差点摔倒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达将她扶稳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>别紧张，娜娜，虽然今天是你第一次担任领诵。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达帮她理顺电线，将麦克风重新递到她手上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>噢！噢放、放心吧！……这点小事……唔、我还不至于紧张！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>……哈哈，那就好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>我就是有点担心，您帮我写的讲稿里有些句子我不太理解，背得还不熟……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>没事，到时我会帮你拿着讲稿，你看着我的口型，我念一句，你说一句。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>好！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518412.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518412.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e4/HeadIconSmall-518412.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518412.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>——嘿！是谁把这群鹅赶到这里的，一会儿队伍要怎么通行？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赶着鹅的邻居抽着鞭子，试图努力将鹅赶走，但灰白羽翼的尖嘴大鹅队伍似乎有自己的考虑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">养禽人：</div><div>它们跟打了兴奋剂一样，不听我使唤！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赶鹅的冲着老金达喊，老金达嫌弃地用手在空中扬了一下，示意对方自行解决。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>金色饰物、高大的圣像、红色的衣料、紫色的头花、蓝色的金刚鹦鹉以及肉香四溢、金桂飘香的迷离空气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群沉醉于此，忘乎所以。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>娜娜剥开人群走过去，蹲下身，抱起一只白鹅。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>嘘、嘘，乖，跟我走吧。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_bg_jishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_bg_jishi\"><img alt=\"2_2_bg_jishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/Cg-2_2_bg_jishi.png/600px-Cg-2_2_bg_jishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/Cg-2_2_bg_jishi.png/900px-Cg-2_2_bg_jishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/83/Cg-2_2_bg_jishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_bg_jishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抱起白鹅，其他白鹅竟乖乖地排成一排，跟在她身后。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>整点的钟声敲响，所有人回过头，看向远方那座纪念屠龙圣徒乔治的钟楼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>游行开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>我从没见过这么大的阵仗，上一次看到这么多人还是五年前那次斗鸡比赛！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅱ：</div><div>这说明有多少人希望这场雨能停下，大家使出吃奶的力气在祈祷呢。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>愿屠龙圣徒能看到我们的诚心，他会对我们建设的城市加以赞扬吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>队伍从福利院向着广场进发，越来越多的人端着蜡烛加入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>娜娜领着一群白鹅走在队伍最前方，她低声哼诵着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div><i>同一个岔口</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div><i>暖阳变寒冷</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div><i>树叶垂落</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div><i>一个吻</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>队伍中也有人在小声跟唱着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div><i>烈火无法</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div><i>将过去化为尘埃</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div><i>直到现在</i></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>跟唱的人越来越多。他们的声音越来越嘹亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>队伍行进到了圣塞巴斯蒂安广场，伟大的圣像立于广场中心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一缕微光照在圣像与圣像面前的娜娜身上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达站在人群中向她挥手，指着自己的嘴，用口型跟她交流。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>看我口型，跟我念。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>娜娜点点头，看着老金达的嘴唇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个毫无关联的想法突入而至，她忽然想起自己从未见过雪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310010.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310010.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/HeadIconSmall-310010.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310010.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……喂？……咳咳，大家好……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>麦克风啸叫，探头探脑的人群开始传来一些骚动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……喂……能听到我说话吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>能——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>嘿嘿……抱歉，我还从没在这么多人面前致辞……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅱ：</div><div>没关系！娜娜！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"520001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"520001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/87/HeadIconSmall-520001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-520001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅲ：</div><div>没事儿的，娜娜！随便给大伙说点什么就行！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>那么，我开始了……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-518401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老金达：</div><div>……开始吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达的声音慢吞吞的。娜娜看着老金达，老金达也看着娜娜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她点了点头，清了清嗓子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达的嘴唇动了，她念了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>或许对于每个人来说，这段时间都不是非常好过的日子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>我们没有看到一片可可树叶挺拔地生长，没有一处木曼陀罗开花，没有一丝阳光为我们停留长于一个昼夜——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>只有雨，永远的雨……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>这样的雨，总让我思念童年。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>襁褓里温柔又逼仄的喘息，扁平的脚掌踩过的荨麻地，一切诗情画意、一派欢欣的代名词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>——童年？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她似乎无声地笑了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……我们真的有如想象般美好的童年吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>当一切美丽都被隔岸观火时，那份遥远的目光似乎显得更加迷人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>而与这种思念同时到来的，是一种更为清晰的发现，即我们似乎再也无法回到过去任何一个令人怀念的快乐时光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>我们站在这个我们所在的地方，在这里我们长大、变老。在这里，我们称其为家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>但这很奇怪，不是吗？为什么我们明明站在这片土地上，我们仍然会怀念它？我们明明从未离去，却感到它一点一点地陌生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310017.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-310017.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310017.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310017.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-310017.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310017.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0c/HeadIconSmall-310017.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310017.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>为什么……为什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她忽然感到恍惚，太阳的光束使人眩晕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>等回过神的时候，人群沉默着，他们带着有些奇怪的目光看向娜娜，有些人则低着头，不动声色。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>娜娜手心出汗，她悄悄擦了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……很、很抱歉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>麦克风再次啸叫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310012.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310012.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/10/HeadIconSmall-310012.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310012.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……呼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有人疑惑地看着娜娜，其中有一些人试图用眼神安抚娜娜的情绪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>很抱歉……以上这些话，我准备了很久，但还是没能背好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达愣在原地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>谢谢你，老金达，你可以不必再提示我，我想说点自己想说的话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老金达缓缓放下手中的稿纸，如同在场所有人一样震惊。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>咳……咳咳——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又是一阵啸叫。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……你、你们看，这里是你们的家，也是我的家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她简单的话语似乎惹来一些人的蹙眉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>又一滴汗从她脸上滑落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>一、一个人，或许可以短暂地离开一下他的家，但他从来不会永远地离开，他总是要回去的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>而我，我很幸运。我从未离开过，也不会离开。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她声音颤抖，但她坚持要说下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>我永远不会离开你们，请放心——我永远不会离开热情之家。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群从窸窣到静默。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>因为就同你们一样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>我也爱着这里的一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>爱着每天胡说八道的鹦鹉，爱着卡米洛售卖的廉价蛇酒，爱着老金达的杏仁糕和老若热的钢琴曲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>鲜红的玫瑰、飘馥的丁香、巨嘴鸟的啼叫，还有这片日出时同阳光一起金灿灿的可可树大地——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>似乎一下子说了太多，她深吸一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>以及——永远也不中断的雨和你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……我爱你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群窒息了，每一个老人都紧紧盯着娜娜。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>我爱你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>鸦雀无声。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>我、我实在不知道还能说些什么……事实上，没有任何语言能够表达我对这片土地的祝福——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>——唯有歌唱，对！唯有——不停地唱下去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她停顿了一下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>那不如——就，歌唱吧！让我们一同歌唱——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>永远地、永远地歌唱下去——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>战争万年长存，我们的热爱将永恒悲苦，我们的歌声也将永不停歇。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群沸腾了，浓烈的巴旦木花的香味充满鼻腔。他们感到眩晕、愉快、茫然、愤怒。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"561101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"561101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/53/HeadIconSmall-561101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-561101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅰ：</div><div>噢天哪，你听到了吗？娜娜说她不会走，她不会走——！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"519901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"519901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/41/HeadIconSmall-519901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-519901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">老人Ⅱ：</div><div>是的，我们不用担心失去她。噢——我在想什么，她当然不会离开我们……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">人群：</div><div>娜娜！娜娜——！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">人群：</div><div>我爱您——！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">人群：</div><div>我爱您——！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">人群：</div><div>您就是我的女神，我的天使，噢，娜娜——！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">人群：</div><div>娜娜，娜娜，娜娜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">人群：</div><div>天使娜娜，天使娜娜，天使娜娜，天使娜娜！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有人，福利院的老人、贩卖商品食物的小贩、不务正业的赌徒、庄园主和他们的劳动工人、唱诗会的孩子们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>所有人都沉浸在这场神圣的狂欢中，而狂欢的尽头，站着阳光笼罩的天使。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>——抱着白鹅，看着世间一切。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-518714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-518714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-518714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫阿西尔：</div><div>身份已完全确认。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-518714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-518714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-518714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫阿西尔：</div><div>她的歌声里有一股魅动的力量，使爱她的人更加热爱她，以至于变成信仰或……欲望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-518714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-518714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-518714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫阿西尔：</div><div>一个……魅魔。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-518714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-518714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-518714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫阿西尔：</div><div>感谢上天，我的等待终于被您兑现。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"518714.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-518714.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-518714.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"518714.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-518714.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-518714.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/79/HeadIconSmall-518714.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-518714.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">莫阿西尔：</div><div>看来这儿确实是一块，无上的福地。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_at_qiangjinana1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_at_qiangjinana1\"><img alt=\"2_2_at_qiangjinana1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Cg-2_2_at_qiangjinana1.png/600px-Cg-2_2_at_qiangjinana1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Cg-2_2_at_qiangjinana1.png/900px-Cg-2_2_at_qiangjinana1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bf/Cg-2_2_at_qiangjinana1.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_at_qiangjinana1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他热泪盈眶。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-baiping.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"baiping\"><img alt=\"baiping\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/600px-Cg-baiping.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/900px-Cg-baiping.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/55/Cg-baiping.png/1200px-Cg-baiping.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>彩灯与火焰正在远去，她向后躺倒，直至坠落。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_at_nana.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_at_nana\"><img alt=\"2_2_at_nana\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Cg-2_2_at_nana.png/600px-Cg-2_2_at_nana.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Cg-2_2_at_nana.png/900px-Cg-2_2_at_nana.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d0/Cg-2_2_at_nana.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_at_nana.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>灯火、舞会、曼妙的人儿、口香糖；枪火、弹壳、下水道的老鼠；咏唱、早餐的烟火、烟灰缸的余烬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>咳嗽、报纸、宇宙、梦中的巨嘴鸟、日复一日的闷雷与细雨。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_2_at_qiangjinana2.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_2_at_qiangjinana2\"><img alt=\"2_2_at_qiangjinana2\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-2_2_at_qiangjinana2.png/600px-Cg-2_2_at_qiangjinana2.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-2_2_at_qiangjinana2.png/900px-Cg-2_2_at_qiangjinana2.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c6/Cg-2_2_at_qiangjinana2.png/1200px-Cg-2_2_at_qiangjinana2.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>以及一个始料未及的问句。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310013.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310013.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/bc/HeadIconSmall-310013.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310013.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>姐姐？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"310014.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-310014.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-310014.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"310014.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-310014.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-310014.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0a/HeadIconSmall-310014.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-310014.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">天使娜娜：</div><div>……为什么？</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "十月无晴天-06"}}